---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /events/
title: 祭典行事曆｜東津代天府靈帝殿
description: 東津代天府靈帝殿迎王祭典、神尊聖誕、法會與遶境活動年度時程。東港迎王三年一科，本殿為班頭制度發源地。
firebase: true
extraCss:
  - events.css
extraJs:
  - events.js
---

<section class="page-head" data-glyph="曆" style="padding-top:56px;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="eyebrow">祭典資訊</div>
    <h2 class="title">祭典行事曆</h2>
    <p class="lede">本殿主祀何府大千歲，於清光緒 30 年甲辰科奉玉旨擔任東港迎王首科大千歲，並為迎王班頭制度發源地。以下為年度祭典與活動時程，實際日期以廟方公告及東港東隆宮公告為準。</p>

    <div class="event-legend">
      <span class="event-type type-迎王">迎王</span>
      <span class="event-type type-神誕">神誕</span>
      <span class="event-type type-法會">法會</span>
      <span class="event-type type-遶境">遶境</span>
      <span class="event-type type-其他">其他</span>
    </div>

    <div class="event-list" id="eventList"></div>
    <div class="empty-state" id="eventEmpty" style="display:none;">尚無行事曆項目。</div>

    <form class="event-form admin-only block" id="eventForm">
      <h3>新增行事曆項目（管理員）</h3>
      <div class="ef-row">
        <label>名稱<input type="text" name="title" placeholder="例如：何府大千歲聖誕千秋" required></label>
        <label>類型<select name="type"></select></label>
      </div>
      <div class="ef-row">
        <label>日期<input type="text" name="date" placeholder="農四月初九　或　2027-10-15" required></label>
        <label class="ef-check"><input type="checkbox" name="recurring"> 每年固定</label>
      </div>
      <label>說明<textarea name="desc" rows="2" placeholder="選填"></textarea></label>
      <button class="btn" type="submit">新增</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  window.__EVENTS_SEED__ = {{ events | dump | safe }};
</script>
